cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Transcribe-HTR in academic work, please cite the software and the paper below."
type: software
title: "Transcribe-HTR: LLM-assisted handwritten text recognition and analysis for historical manuscripts"
abstract: >-
  A web application for transcribing handwritten historical documents with
  vision-capable large language models from OpenAI, Google, and Anthropic. It
  supports multi-model transcription, character- and word-level consistency
  analysis, consensus reconciliation, named-entity recognition, and structured
  export.
authors:
